{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the ruler of a fictional ancient empire, managing your nation's internal affairs and commanding armies to defend your borders against invading foreign tribes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fictional yet Distinctive Ancient Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in a fictional era inspired by ancient Chinese aesthetics. The interface, terminology, and overall presentation are steeped in traditional Chinese style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121840/extras/884c59c0af09f98a4fa0249c920d6b21.webp?t=1762487688\" width=610 height=61 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Internal Affairs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 135 prefectures (Fu) and 15 provincial administration offices (Buzhengsi). You can individually manage the internal affairs of each unit, choose to construct different buildings, adjust official appointments and dismissals, and monitor civil welfare and grain supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 13 types of local buildings, with individual quantity management for each.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also need to monitor data such as local granaries, government grain reserves, and civilian surplus grain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, you must organize the transport of supplies to battlefields or other locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121840/extras/4b1536eb87155236f9b9d94639236b8f.avif?t=1762487688\" width=584 height=428 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Enemies on the Sandbox Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your armies on a sandbox map in turn-based combat against enemy forces. Utilize terrain advantages or delegate command to generals for automatic execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121840/extras/bd2fbb08b696fa112811d621fb0f186d.avif?t=1762487688\" width=884 height=554 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121840?t=1762487688","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121840?t=1762487688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121840/db0dd60b84d98928e3bb217c37dc3d2268a0d28a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762487688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121840/db0dd60b84d98928e3bb217c37dc3d2268a0d28a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762487688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the ruler of a fictional ancient empire, managing your nation's internal affairs and commanding armies to defend your borders against invading foreign tribes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fictional yet Distinctive Ancient Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in a fictional era inspired by ancient Chinese aesthetics. The interface, terminology, and overall presentation are steeped in traditional Chinese style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121840/extras/884c59c0af09f98a4fa0249c920d6b21.webp?t=1762487688\" width=610 height=61 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Internal Affairs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 135 prefectures (Fu) and 15 provincial administration offices (Buzhengsi). You can individually manage the internal affairs of each unit, 